@body

- Exam review session 2\:00pm!
- Timing\:
  - Open 3\:00pm Wed, Feb 28th
  - Finish 10\:00pm Sun, March 3rd
- Take anytime between 3pm Wednesday and 10pm Sunday
  - For example, Thurs night for part 2 and then Sunday morning for part 1.
- Once you open one part of the exam, the timer does begin, so you have to finish that part in one sitting

