# Course Evaluations

@body

- Hi Students,
- You will be receiving an email to complete course evaluations for your courses.
- I want to encourage you to complete them, they are our primary source for evaluating faculty performance.
- Your opinion does matter; it can help determine who gets salary raises, and a string of negative evaluations can get a professor replaced.
- Further, I appreciate getting your feedback in an anonymous way. It helps me improve the courses I teach.
- Thanks, Dr. Voss

